msgstr "Stäng"

#. translators: 1: opening <a> tag to the privacy policy (omitted if it isn't published yet), 2: closing </a> tag
#: includes/ContactForm/Modal.php:132
#, php-format
msgid "We process your personal data to answer your message. Read more in our %1$sprivacy policy%2$s."
msgstr "Vi behandlar dina personuppgifter för att kunna svara på ditt meddelande. Läs mer i vår %1$sintegritetspolicy%2$s."

